OL,3,GNEWSAMove to support rather than punish
OL,4,Aabsent pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils and families will be supported
OL,7,Finstead of punished for repeated school
OL,8,Fabsences, a council has said.
OL,10,FGloucestershire County Council has
OL,11,Flaunched a new school attendance
OL,12,Fstrategy to coincide with the start of
OL,13,Fa new school year, aiming to give
OL,14,Ffamilies practical help to keep
OL,15,Fchildren in class.
OL,17,FOne in ten secondary pupils and one in
OL,18,F20 primary pupils were repeatedly
OL,19,Fabsent from school in Gloucestershire
OL,20,Fin 2024, in line with national rates.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
