OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1788436583
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAMove to support rather than punish
OL,4,Aabsent pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FKathleen McGillycuddy, principial of
OL,7,FTewkesbury Academy, said that while
OL,8,F"sanctions, fines and punishment" had a
OL,9,Fplace in dealing with absence,
OL,10,F"building strong relationships with our
OL,11,Ffamilies and offering support" could
OL,12,Fmean better outcomes.
